  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "[PropHolders_UpperChest_GreatSword]\r\n\r\nThis is an asset that determines
    the transform position and rotation when attaching 'prop GreatSword' to the character's
    'UpperChest'.\r\n\n(1) Attach the nodes as follows.\r\n- Attach 'PropHolders_UpperChest_GreatSword'
    as a child to the character skeleton 'UpperChest'.\r\nAttach 'prf_Prop_R_GreatSword1'
    as a child to 'PropHolder_GreatSword_R'.\r\n\r\n\n(2) Reset the transform position
    and rotation of the \r\nPropHolders_UpperChest_GreatSword, \r\nprf_Prop_R_GreatSword1
    (*Prop Asset)\r\nnodes to (0,0,0). Then, the GreatSword_R will be placed like
    the sample characters below."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
